        <summary>
          <para>This constant was deprecated in API level 33. refer to setForceDark(int)</para>
          <para>Disable force dark, irrespective of the force dark mode of the WebView parent. In this mode, WebView content will always be rendered as-is, regardless of whether native views are being automatically darkened.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/webkit/WebSettings#FORCE_DARK_OFF" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.webkit.WebSettings.FORCE_DARK_OFF</code>.</a></format></para>
